{"verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"Mbingu zinatangaza utukufu wa Mungu,"},{"verse":2,"text":"Siku baada ya siku zinatoa habari,"},{"verse":3,"text":"Hakuna msemo wala lugha,"},{"verse":4,"text":"Sauti yao imeenea duniani pote,"},{"verse":5,"text":"linafanana na bwana arusi"},{"verse":6,"text":"Huchomoza upande mmoja wa mbingu,"},{"verse":7,"text":"Sheria ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* ni kamilifu,"},{"verse":8,"text":"Maagizo ya \\nd Bwana\\nd* ni kamili,"},{"verse":9,"text":"Kumcha \\nd Bwana\\nd* ni utakatifu,"},{"verse":10,"text":"Ni za thamani kuliko dhahabu,"},{"verse":11,"text":"Kwa hizo mtumishi wako anaonywa,"},{"verse":12,"text":"Ni nani awezaye kutambua makosa yake?"},{"verse":13,"text":"Mlinde mtumishi wako na dhambi za makusudi,"},{"verse":14,"text":"Maneno ya kinywa changu"}]}